 of Egypt.","Napoleon Pardoning the Rebels at Cairo"],"65519367":["Portrait of Henri de la Rochejaquelein is an oil on canvas portrait painting by the French artist Pierre-Narcisse Guérin, from 1816.","Portrait of Henri de la Rochejaquelein"],"132176194":["The Death of Brutus is a 1793 neoclassical history painting by the French artist Pierre-Narcisse Guérin. It depicts the corpse Marcus Junius Brutus, of the leaders of the assassination of Julius Caesar, being carried aloft following his suicide after the defeat at the Battle of Philippi.","The Death of Brutus"]},"titlesFrom":["fr","P1476","alias:en","alias:fr","aliasFilter:1"]}